        "code": {
          "text": "Reported health-related worries and reassurance seeking"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Very worried about relapse or brain cancer; searches online about cryptococcal meningitis, coma, blindness and deafness, and repeatedly requests scans or lumbar puncture. Worried that phone use and workplace fluorescent lights increase brain pressure and that funny-smelling tap water worsens infection. Remained anxious and repeatedly sought reassurance."
      }
